  "name": "apitrace",
  "description": "A comprehensive suite for tracing, inspecting, and replaying graphics API calls across OpenGL, OpenGL ES, and Direct3D backends. It enables deep analysis of graphics workloads through state reconstruction, frame-by-frame profiling, and visual regression testing. The project employs sophisticated API interposition techniques to capture and serialize command streams for cross-platform debugging.",
